WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.267
What happens when two strangers want to do business but neither trusts the other?

2
00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:09.800
Normally, you need a middleman. A bank. A lawyer. A platform.

3
00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:13.500
Blockchain removes the middleman entirely.

4
00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:18.033
Instead of trusting a person or company — you trust the math.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.800
When a transaction happens on a blockchain, thousands of computers verify it.

6
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:27.000
No single person controls it. No server can alter the record.

7
00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:30.700
The history is permanent. And everyone can see it.

8
00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:34.133
Blockchain is not just about cryptocurrency.

9
00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:38.267
It is about creating trust between people who have never met.

10
00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:43.033
Smart contracts: self-executing agreements — no lawyers, no delays.

11
00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:47.767
Web3 is building a new infrastructure for trust on the internet.

12
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:53.100
Start learning Web3 at 0xverse Academy.

